#
# FOUR PREREQUISITES HAD TO BE FIXED BEFORE THE QUESTION COULD BE ASKED, and every
# one of them was already flagged in the codebase or in memory:
#   1. tools/ctxgenome.sh produced a genome FAILING calibrate (somato 4.16 vs a
#      declared 4.56). Now measures somato and writes the target in: PASS.
#   2. context_slots = 0 left the machinery inert -- ctx_slots_ needs > 1 -- so
