#   4. BOTH LESSONS HAD THE SAME CAREGIVER WORD. run_retain_arm's own comment said
#      so: "retain says the same word throughout ... which is the thing that was
#      never tested." Fixed with the existing cfg.second_heard = 1.
#
# WITH ALL FOUR HOLDING:
#   derived  separation 0.012 +/- 0.003   over 12 creatures
#   latch    separation 0.021 +/- 0.011
#   oracle   agreement 1.000 (by construction)
#
# THE INDEX IS ACTIVE, NOT INERT. A constant index gives agreement equal to the trial
